---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for Handheld GameDB. Read our terms before using the platform.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-invert prose-emerald max-w-none">

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: March 8, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of Handheld GameDB ("the Service"), operated by Handheld GameDB ("we", "us", "our"). By accessing or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
      </p>

      <!-- Acceptance -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          By creating an account or using Handheld GameDB, you agree to these Terms and our <a href="/privacy" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree to any part of these Terms, you must not use the Service.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          You must be at least 13 years of age to use the Service. By using the Service, you represent that you meet this requirement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- User Accounts -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. User Accounts</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          To submit reports, vote, and access certain features, you must create an account via Google OAuth. You are responsible for:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Maintaining the security of your account credentials</li>
          <li>All activity that occurs under your account</li>
          <li>Notifying us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or engage in prohibited conduct.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Submissions -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. Content Submissions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          When you submit performance reports, reviews, votes, or other content to Handheld GameDB, you agree that:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Your submissions are your own original work or you have the right to submit them</li>
          <li>Your submissions are accurate and truthful to the best of your knowledge</li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">All submitted reports are licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY)</a></strong>. This means anyone may use, share, and adapt your reports with proper attribution
          </li>
          <li>You grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to use, display, aggregate, and distribute your submissions as part of the database</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          You retain ownership of your original content. The CC-BY license ensures the community database remains open and accessible.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Prohibited Conduct -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Submit false, misleading, or fabricated performance data</li>
          <li>Manipulate votes or ratings through fake accounts or automated means</li>
          <li>Harass, abuse, or threaten other users</li>
          <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Service, other accounts, or our infrastructure</li>
          <li>Scrape or harvest data from the Service in a manner that exceeds reasonable use or bypasses rate limits</li>
          <li>Upload malware, spam, or any malicious content</li>
          <li>Impersonate another person or entity</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Violation of these rules may result in immediate account suspension or permanent ban, at our sole discretion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Disclaimers -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">5. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          The Service is provided <strong class="text-white">"as is"</strong> and <strong class="text-white">"as available"</strong> without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Accuracy, reliability, or completeness of performance data</li>
          <li>Uninterrupted or error-free operation of the Service</li>
          <li>Fitness for a particular purpose</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Performance data is community-contributed and may not reflect your actual experience. Settings that work on one unit may differ on another due to hardware variance, software versions, driver updates, and other factors. Always use the data as a starting point, not a guarantee.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Handheld GameDB is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Valve Corporation, ASUS, Lenovo, MSI, or any other device manufacturer.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Limitation of Liability -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Handheld GameDB and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>Loss of data or profits</li>
          <li>Damage to hardware from applying community-suggested settings</li>
          <li>Interruption of service</li>
          <li>Any other damages arising from your use of the Service</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Our total liability for any claim arising from or related to the Service shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim, if any.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Changes to Terms -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make material changes, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, notify you via the Service or email.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms. If you do not agree to the updated Terms, you should stop using the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@handheldgamedb.com" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline">hello@handheldgamedb.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
